th Danny but  I thought that was an interesting way to  put it but it also says there would be a  love triangle between John Tyrion and  Arya it actually says this would turn  into a deadly rivalry between John and  Tyrion and we never even got a hint of  this in the television show or the books  yet but some people believe they may do  a version of this in the show ever since  Tyrion gave that look as John and  Daenerys were having sex on the boat  I've even seen some people say they may  do this deadly rivalry between John and  Tyrion over the love of Daenerys it did  appear that Tyrion was upset but I don't  actually believe it was because he was  jealous of John I think Tyrion must know  how this is going to complicate things  in the future  Tyrion may also feel his influence  slipping away even more now he's already  made enough bad decisions that has  Daenerys no longer taking his advice but  with her in love with John now she may  never listen to Tyrion again and instead  follow everything  john wants to do in tearing can sense  this may be happening sooner than later  but that's just my opinion as you can  see most of this draft has changed in  many ways george only planned on writing  three books to complete his series but  as we all know he wants to write seven  books now and they are all over 700  pages long which is what he was  originally thinking net and Caitlin  still died but not exactly how he had  planned Ned was never able to save  Catelyn and Arya by getting them back to  Winterfell Catelyn did not die beyond  the walls she died at the red wedding  and was resurrected as Lady Stoneheart  in Robb Stark never died on the  battlefield like he wanted either he  died at the red wedding too and I'm  actually glad the red wedding was done  the way it was instead it ended up being  one of the greatest episodes in  television history in my opinion Joffrey  was never maimed on the battlefield by  Robb either although that would have  been fantastic and Sons I never had  Joffrey's baby either thank the old gods  in the new Antarian never burned down  Winterfell Catelyn Arya and bran never  met John at the wall they never went  beyond the wall and met mance rayder  either and Daenerys never killed Khal  Drogo to avenge her brother's death  she didn't stumble across the dragon  eggs just lying somewhere either and  most of all Jaime never murdered anyone  to sit on the Iron Throne  could you imagine Jaime killing everyone  next in line to be on the throne and  actually blaming Tyrion for the murders  that would have completely changed  Tyrion and Jaime's relationship and I'm  glad it never went down like that but I  think that's enough examples as you can  see so much has changed and this leads  me to the most important question of  them all do you think the five central  characters George planned on having  survived the entire series still remains  the same  well Jon Daenerys Tyrion brain and arias  still make it through the end and  another question is will these  characters survive the entire Game of  Thrones series - George said he wanted  to write a story that made the readers  feel like no one is ever safe even the  heroes the drama in suspense really  ranch up an arch when you know that any  character can die at any time but even  with all that in mind he still wanted to  keep these five people alive no matter  what but in my opinion I don't think  they are all as safe as he once had  planned in the show it might be  different - because they haven't been  killing as many loved characters as they  use  - ever since they went off the books  they did kill Stannis and Lady Olenna  but even those deaths were done off  screen the biggest character they killed  was Jon Snow but they brought him right  back and that's even in the books  the only character that feels 100% safe  to me as Tyrion Lannister and I really  don't know why but he just seems to feel  like he will make it all the way through  I feel that way about Samwell Tarly - I  think they're going to be two of the  characters left over that will help  rebuild and restore Westeros and make it  great again but the other four  characters John Daenerys bran and Arya I  feel like they are in danger I think any  one of them can die in the last book or  the last episode and I don't know which  ones will die or how but I could easily  see John sacrificing himself or even  Brian having to sacrifice himself in his  powers to put an end to the night king  these are just my opinions though but  tell me how you feel about all this do  you believe they are still safe as  George intended or do you think any of  them can die now that he has changed so  many other things which ones do you  think will die or survive at the end of  the game of Thrones television series  let me know all your questions and  thoughts down below because I'm very  curious to see what the majority of you  have to say about this I want to thank  you all for taking the time out of your  day to watch the video I really  appreciate all of you for doing that and  I also want to thank my patreon  supporters - I hope you all have a great  day bye  you
 

